              "content": "Similar as the tag_create operation, this will update the desired tag (Subcommunity), identified by the provided `tag_id`.\n\nThis is a delta-update, i.e., omitted fields will not modify the Subcommunity. I.e.: If you only want to update the tag's `title` but leave color and description the same, only pass the `tag_id` and the `title`, so that the rest will stay the same.",
